<title>GREECE: FUND MANAGERS BRIEFED ON SELONDA, RIOPESCA, BRITANNIA.</title>
<headline>FUND MANAGERS BRIEFED ON SELONDA, RIOPESCA, BRITANNIA.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Institutional investors heard company presentations by executives of fish farming firms Selonda , Riopesca and textiles firm Britannia, the association of Greek Institutional Investors said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Fund managers were briefed on company prospects by Selonda and Riopesca executives John Stefanis and Christos Giannopoulos and Brittania president Dimitris Antonakos.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
